{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026p8zYONav461795128854.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價普遍向下。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合130.73元，比本港收市低2.57元。工商銀行7.85元，低2仙。建設銀行10.39元，低9仙。友邦保險75.15元，低0.4元。港交所367.03元，低3.77元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股346.32元，低2.08元。阿里巴巴81.67元，高1.12元。理想汽車44.07元，低0.55元。金沙中國10.4元，低3仙。長和65.8元，低0.35元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:44:29.446302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.013672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:37:43.035183+00:00","content_hash":"5a868f0595fde4862ea7ad544a1e7a66071dd61ac5ef96018d9bedceaa6201d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:44:29.446302+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}